            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[- Choosing "Horsing around" now occasionally asks once more before it starts: *Do you actually want
  to horse around?* — "No, I actually have something to do" takes you to naming a task, "Yes, horse
  around" starts it as usual. Never twice in a day, and on no pattern you can anticipate.
]]></description>
